{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "2be239014b01945fdebce6d219bdc71bd9b7064f32c4be1b53eeeee97f4a2738", "ja": "私たちのプレゼン、聞いてください！", "zh": "请听听我们的方案展示！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dac90cffe0ea1615f4b6a14db3a92d2884490adf800f30b72645c765e9542490", "ja": "そして本番。紬、可奈、ひなたはそれぞれの\n切り口で臨んだ地元プレゼンを無事にやり\n遂げる。達成感に包まれた3人はその勢いの\nまま、プロデューサーに「結局誰のプレゼン\nが一番よかったのか」と迫るのだった。", "zh": "然后迎来了正式演讲。纺、可奈和日向分别从各自的角度出发，顺利完成了家乡介绍。被成就感包围的3人趁着这股劲头，追问制作人：“结果，到底谁的演讲最好？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4320c5cc29cf543634ebc9edf2c0a57f80f8f17be8c68d98cfc2c58991635266", "ja": "（3人は地元を直接訪れ、方向性を決めて、\nプレゼンの企画を固めていった。迎えるは本番……）", "zh": "（3人亲自前往当地，确定了方向，最终敲定了演讲企划。接下来迎来的就是正式演出……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "018e1af62d3859f558c0aab34c1305e89d6b5ba950cd1cb71a53a5eb22d67a53", "ja": "（さて、準備は整ったはず。\n勝負の行方は果たして……！）", "zh": "那么，准备应该都做好了。胜负究竟会如何……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dd748bb3a24683f8c34b8af980a19031e4abb51a92f09ed4a97d9532811c925e", "ja": "こうした金沢の観光資源を保存しつつも、\nさらなるインバウンドの需要に応えるために……。", "zh": "在保护金泽这些旅游资源的同时，为了满足不断增长的入境旅游需求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0fc4e6786aaae50521b3f47f4d691913f56912bdebe23d1e0a0f914dabae9608", "ja": "サステナブルな意識を踏まえることで、一層の\n発展を遂げることができると感じた次第です！", "zh": "我由此深切感受到，只要秉持可持续发展的理念，就能实现进一步发展！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "4c2af7273855f8fe8808bc13a118244516c47f17d9af815a0c27acd7e45257a0", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "dc5fec0a3dbd08d88c6a32e79b7815906dddb0ae2bea2ccc00771cca02d35f47", "ja": "こうして、洋菓子店は、砂糖の問屋さんの\nまかないから始まっていることがわかりました。", "zh": "就这样，我们了解到，西式糕点店原来是从砂糖批发商的员工餐开始的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "54f63cacab36fe18bd1c3563f0d6ce89b5cf320879a06f3bb2e2c7ea0855eff5", "ja": "横浜のスイーツから、味だけじゃなくて、\nいろんな歴史も感じてもらえたらうれしいです！", "zh": "如果大家能从横滨的甜点中，不仅品尝到美味，还能感受到各种历史，我会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1007_audience", "source_sha256": "4c2af7273855f8fe8808bc13a118244516c47f17d9af815a0c27acd7e45257a0", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "f1f7658e83c0f8dd92be0946cf6c55c85d991094b4f75d2316d8870d9c475be2", "ja": "夏のひまわり、冬の樹氷……春にも夏にも。あの町は\nずっと変わりなく、今年もおんなじふうだと思います。", "zh": "夏天的向日葵、冬天的树冰……在春天也是，在夏天也是。那个小镇\n一直都没有变过，我想今年也还是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "7a43d674f1aff39fa3225e084feb62399f888d5f1036651ec1fd46b2302ef23c", "ja": "だから、焦らなくて平気です。いつでもいいので……\n一度訪れて、自分の目で見てみてほしいです。", "zh": "所以，不用着急。什么时候去都可以……\n希望你能去一趟，亲眼看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "81f9e497f45c164a19c338d0dce553d94e7ba7cf50f05f8b52427b3d7d82ee74", "ja": "変わらない町が迎えてくれます。今日のプレゼンを、\n心のどっかに残して、覚えておいてねぇ！", "zh": "永远不变的小镇会迎接大家的。要是大家能把今天的发表，\n留在心里的某个角落记住就好了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1011_audience", "source_sha256": "4c2af7273855f8fe8808bc13a118244516c47f17d9af815a0c27acd7e45257a0", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "be63e1b1fa567b85943dd015da9dd5b06b2aff87917e9766423220ddfb692618", "ja": "この後、投票が行われる形だけど……\nひとまずみんな、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "接下来要进行投票……\n总之，大家真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "942137bf3a44191908b1f9116721a5733d1bff6ba300510b42c092cfb16cf061", "ja": "アイドルのお仕事っていうより、\n学校の授業の発表みたいでしたね！　緊張した～。", "zh": "与其说是偶像的工作，不如说更像是在学校课堂上做发表呢！紧张死我了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "83ea8db40cb3029128ca9ad1e14f6f72699bcaf860b7735e84fd3cbcfa579a4f", "ja": "ええ。やはり、ライブなどとは\n違う緊張感でした。", "zh": "是的。果然和演唱会之类的场合不同，有着另一种紧张感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "08952f59b64dcc1b0831e299fa64a8e222f0011b850135f9e73995a4d86352db", "ja": "でも、ふたりとも立派だったべさ。\nハキハキしてて、よくまとまっていて……。", "zh": "不过，你们两个都很出色啊。表达清楚，配合得也很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "642cc21966734d2e3d79c17ac30de521ebf23a5c056bd24f1c168e4be9dbea30", "ja": "あたしは紬さんのプレゼン、\n内容が詰まっててよかったと思ったよぉ。", "zh": "我觉得，紬小姐的演讲内容很充实，挺不错的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a55f03df8e92d7056945253b8a1d3dcb90758709a6515f779cc6a4697e758c46", "ja": "ありがとうございます。何とかまとめましたが、\n個人的には情報の羅列に終始してしまった印象で……。", "zh": "谢谢您。虽然总算是总结出来了，\n但在我个人看来，感觉最后只是在罗列信息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6ad8b1fd8550282bc525427763ab4b7ef178048cc2f7aba0ca023df261f7128c", "ja": "あれもこれもと手を出さず、\n最初からテーマを絞ればよかったのかもしれません。", "zh": "要是不去面面俱到，\n从一开始就把主题缩小一点就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ad4dd4c1a785d7c835b88f672776398f1040d2e6bdf1caeebedfa525dfc541c6", "ja": "その点で言えば、矢吹さんのプレゼンは\n矢吹さんらしい視点で素晴らしかったですね。", "zh": "从这一点来说，矢吹小姐的演讲以矢吹小姐特有的视角展开，真是精彩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "07fbdee2a0494a803d232b99a0697fba82dfe83071a7483655ea22b9f581b5ef", "ja": "えへへ♪　でも、私も反省点あるんです。\nもっといろんなお店を掘り下げたかったから……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪不过，我也有需要反省的地方。\n因为本来想再深入了解更多不同的店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "6f8c4f9f040d43a61de9ae1330d7593a555abb4b6d2783b291793bc15be2ef42", "ja": "私は、ひなたちゃんの内容が一番よかったな！\n最後のスピーチ、じ～んと来ちゃったもん！", "zh": "我觉得日向的内容最好！\n她最后的演讲真的让我特别感动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "808fbb58fa2a6fb7d7ed20809eaff18e2428e4fd06987cd35f9be5c3ea6d1d8d", "ja": "そうかい？\nなんだか照れてしまうねぇ。", "zh": "这样啊？\n总觉得有点不好意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f9e66bc4181bb13b19267a2460393bfe837e7230ffe03b4df2170ab3aeb27106", "ja": "互いの健闘を称えあう……いい勝負ができた証拠だな。\nどれも個性が出ていてとてもよかったと思うぞ！", "zh": "互相称赞彼此的努力……这正是我们打了一场精彩比赛的证明啊。\n每一个都展现出了各自的个性，我觉得非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a052e9b237afc6c4298409d431a6e3ae7c590536d3d11cbca98fe6b55bc48663", "ja": "？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "？ 怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "166739ee511d05febb346a4e07aaa2e467f887eb19b0e41b3b7ef3cf6a7abed8", "ja": "えっと……{$P$}さんは、\n誰のプレゼンが一番よかったですか？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，谁的演示做得最好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "ff9a2210fddf273e6250f7253e028b526cfdd1d95d98089f292d8cf8f208a90e", "ja": "あたしも、気になってたんだよぉ。\n資料作りを教えるのも上手だったし……。", "zh": "我也一直很在意呢。\n教我们制作资料时也教得很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e36cdffb5d0106457a24748a8aed6ec0acf7a7e8cdb2fda1fadd6fd8d664c70f", "ja": "私たちの手伝いをそつなくこなせたのです。\nプレゼンに対する正確な評価も、下せるはずでしょう。", "zh": "我们交代的事情，你都能妥善处理好。\n对于演示文稿，你应该也能给出准确的评价吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ff39c1e7a680dc127b0d874d4b223472e6c432757093b827c6183b783b630936", "ja": "プレゼンっていうのは、評価にいろんな視点があって\n一概にはちょっと判断が難しいというか……。", "zh": "所谓演示，评价时会有各种不同的角度，想一概而论地判断，还是有点困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "cc293a020fee23efccf8bff65f994ecc42a4d592e5200d79da4f9456bef3df09", "ja": "発表の順番も大事だし、直近のニュースで内容の強度が\n変わったり、先行研究、新規性の有無とかも……。", "zh": "发表的顺序也很重要，而且近期的新闻可能会改变内容的力度，还有先行研究、是否具有新颖性之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_06_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "8d542d8e4f1ce4a85d85fb29ec0601948365ea5c8d0cd3248bf132e1318e3b32", "ja": "う～……いろいろ言ってるけど、結局誰なんですか！？\nこれは勝負なんですから、決めてください！", "zh": "呜～……说了这么多，结果到底是谁嘛！？\n这可是比赛，所以请决定一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
